sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Operator API or AWS zonal autoshift
    participant A as ARC
    participant E as EKS
    participant K as Karpenter integration
    T->>A: Start eligible zonal shift
    A-->>E: Shift state for impaired AZ
    E->>E: Cordon affected nodes and remove affected Pod IPs from relevant endpoints
    K->>A: Poll zonal shift state
    K->>K: Avoid new capacity in impaired AZ
    K->>K: Pause specified voluntary disruptions
    Note over E,K: Native shift does not evict Pods or terminate nodes
